8-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2018 Q3","e":"car","d":"2018-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Larry De Shon","x":"Whether, we will have positive pricing overall in commercial for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/06/avis-budget-group-inc-car-q3-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2018 Q4","e":"car","d":"2019-02-21","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Larry D. De Shon","x":"Don't forget, we have not fully matured in our ability to sell through alternative channels and within the alternative channels we still need to move our segments to be able to drive more direct to consumer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/avis-budget-group-inc-car-q4-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2018 Q4","e":"car","d":"2019-02-21","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Larry D. De Shon","x":"Although, we have been improving our direct to consumer, we have opened last, last year and our retail lots are starting to really get their momentum as well and we'll plan to open new lots again this year, but we want to continue driving direct to consumer, which will also benefit us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/avis-budget-group-inc-car-q4-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2018 Q4","e":"car","d":"2019-02-21","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Derek Glenn","x":"And are you willing to see share to generate positive pricing growth?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/avis-budget-group-inc-car-q4-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2018 Q4","e":"car","d":"2019-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Larry D. De Shon","x":"Connected vehicles not only allow customers to manage their entire rental experience through the mobile app, they also allow us to streamline our operations and reduce costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/avis-budget-group-inc-car-q4-2018-earnings-confere.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q1","e":"car","d":"2019-05-02","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"John North","x":"Looking forward, one of the key initiatives that we are focused on is the growth of our alternative disposition channels, particularly our direct-to-consumer sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/avis-budget-group-car-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q1","e":"car","d":"2019-05-02","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"John North","x":"Each vehicle we dispose through alternative channels saves us hundreds of dollars in disposal costs, and each vehicle we sell direct to consumer generates more than $1,000 of additional benefit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/avis-budget-group-car-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q1","e":"car","d":"2019-05-02","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"John North","x":"Very clearly, there's about a $1,000 benefit in terms of direct to consumer, so I think those are well understood.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/avis-budget-group-car-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q1","e":"car","d":"2019-05-02","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"John North","x":"The thing I'd point out, first and foremost, is that we have the ultimate test drive with Avis, which, in a way, is a direct to consumer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/avis-budget-group-car-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q1","e":"car","d":"2019-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John North","x":"Many of the -- there are several revenue initiatives that we're running, but there are many cost-savings initiatives as well that we would continue to look at.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/avis-budget-group-car-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q1","e":"car","d":"2019-05-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John North","x":"In the other areas, we continue to streamline organizations, take a look at opportunities to streamline and to expand responsibilities of key folks in the organization to be able to bring down overall S&W cost.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/avis-budget-group-car-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q1","e":"car","d":"2019-05-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Larry De Shon","x":"Finally, as you saw in our release last night, we reaffirmed our full-year guidance and key metrics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/03/avis-budget-group-car-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q2","e":"car","d":"2019-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"John North","x":"We continue to be focused on the growth of our alternative disposition channels, particularly our direct-to-consumer sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/avis-budget-group-car-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q2","e":"car","d":"2019-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"John North","x":"Each vehicle we dispose through alternative channel saves us hundreds of dollars in disposal costs and each vehicle we sell direct to consumer generates more than $1,000 of additional benefit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/avis-budget-group-car-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q2","e":"car","d":"2019-08-06","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Larry De Shon","x":"And we have grown direct to consumer significantly, but we have a long ways to go direct to consumer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/avis-budget-group-car-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q2","e":"car","d":"2019-08-06","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Larry De Shon","x":"So the more that we can continue to sell direct to consumer, which we more than doubled what we saw in the quarter where we sold direct to consumers last year, and the more that we can continue to grow that that will give us over $1,500 benefit for the car versus $450.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/07/avis-budget-group-car-q2-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q3","e":"car","d":"2019-11-01","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"John North","x":"We continue to be focused on the growth of our alternative disposition channels, particularly our direct-to-consumer sales, which have grown 136% in 2019 from the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/avis-budget-group-car-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q3","e":"car","d":"2019-11-01","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"John North","x":"And each vehicle we sell direct to consumer can generate more than $1,000 of additional benefit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/avis-budget-group-car-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q3","e":"car","d":"2019-11-01","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Larry De Shon","x":"So our direct-to-consumer is up quite a bit in the quarter, but we have a long runway to go.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/avis-budget-group-car-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q3","e":"car","d":"2019-11-01","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Larry De Shon","x":"Our direct to consumer, where we see our largest benefit, will continue to grow as our -- as the locations that we're selling cars through continue to mature, and as we open new locations next year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/avis-budget-group-car-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q3","e":"car","d":"2019-11-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Larry De Shon","x":"Last year, we had I think it was really kind of started with the threat of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/avis-budget-group-car-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q3","e":"car","d":"2019-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Larry De Shon","x":"These adjustments have delivered signs of positive pricing in the back half of October and beyond.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/avis-budget-group-car-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q3","e":"car","d":"2019-11-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Larry De Shon","x":"Despite seven European airlines halting operations and the recent bankruptcy in the travel and leisure market, the international team was able to mitigate lost volume while achieving a price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/avis-budget-group-car-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q3","e":"car","d":"2019-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Larry De Shon","x":"However, in September, both industrywide accelerated fleet dispositions and significantly fewer new vehicle purchases have helped to rightsize supply.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/avis-budget-group-car-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q3","e":"car","d":"2019-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John North","x":"Third-quarter EBITDA of $178 million was consistent with prior year in constant currency, expanding margin to more than 19%, a 13 basis point improvement from prior year, and in part due to our cost reduction program as well as acquisitions and divestitures in the last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/01/avis-budget-group-car-q3-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q4","e":"car","d":"2020-02-20","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Joe Ferraro","x":"We are focused on growing the direct-to-consumer channel through expansion of our retail location footprint, which has doubled in the year to 14 locations; and Ultimate Test Drive, our online vehicle sales platform where you can drive before you buy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/avis-budget-group-car-q4-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q4","e":"car","d":"2020-02-20","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Joe Ferraro","x":"Our direct-to-consumer channels sold approximately 13,000 cars, more than doubling their output from prior years.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/avis-budget-group-car-q4-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q4","e":"car","d":"2020-02-20","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"John North","x":"Our direct-to-consumer efforts will help us offset a portion of the increase, bringing us to our guidance range of flat to up 3%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/avis-budget-group-car-q4-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q4","e":"car","d":"2020-02-20","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Derek Glynn","x":"Just trying to parse that out from potentially some expected impact from other initiatives like direct to consumer and whatnot.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/avis-budget-group-car-q4-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2019 Q4","e":"car","d":"2020-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Ferraro","x":"Additionally, Connected Cars are allowing us to implement new and automated business processes, streamline operations, improve the overall level of service delivered to our customers and help maximize management of our fleet.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/20/avis-budget-group-car-q4-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2020 Q1","e":"car","d":"2020-05-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Joe Ferraro","x":"The majority of our disposals will be through alternative channels, including direct-to-dealer and direct-to-consumer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/avis-budget-group-car-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2020 Q1","e":"car","d":"2020-05-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Joe Ferraro","x":"We operate 14 retail locations in five states, as well as online direct-to-consumer sales offering ultimate test drive.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/avis-budget-group-car-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2020 Q1","e":"car","d":"2020-05-05","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Joe Ferraro","x":"So we rely heavily on direct-to-dealer, which we have terrific relationships, and our direct-to-consumer product, whether it be who are -- we have 14 retail stores now.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/avis-budget-group-car-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2020 Q1","e":"car","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Ferraro","x":"We took dramatic action, including significant reductions in personnel, shrinking the size of our fleet and halting all nonessential spending, initially targeting $400 million in annualized cost savings, which we've materially improved upon over the last month.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/avis-budget-group-car-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2020 Q1","e":"car","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Ferraro","x":"We've taken quick and decisive actions to reduce headcount, rightsize the fleet and remove unprecedented amount of both fixed and variable costs, exceeding $2 billion annually.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/avis-budget-group-car-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"CAR 2020 Q4","e":"car","d":"2021-02-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Ferraro","x":"After our initial actions, we put out a release stating that we removed approximately $400 million in expenses, but we quickly realized it wasn't enough and challenged our team to do more by continuing to align our cost savings with that of our revenue declines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/17/avis-budget-group-inc-car-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"CAR 2020 Q4","e":"car","d":"2021-02-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joe Ferraro","x":"The team did a great job matching cost savings with revenue declines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/17/avis-budget-group-inc-car-q4-2020-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"CAR 2021 Q1","e":"car","d":"2021-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"John Healy","x":"And just one follow-up on the cost takeout.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/avis-budget-group-inc-car-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"CAR 2021 Q1","e":"car","d":"2021-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"John Healy","x":"I guess could you just update us on how much of the cost takeout you think will be permanent and how much will come back?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/avis-budget-group-inc-car-q1-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"CAR 2021 Q2","e":"car","d":"2021-08-04","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Aileen Elizabeth Smith","x":"And we spent a lot of time in the past number of years talking about our car exiting strategy, concentrating more on direct-to-consumer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/avis-budget-group-inc-car-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"CAR 2021 Q2","e":"car","d":"2021-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian J. Choi","x":"And as you see in the numbers, like our international team has delivered spectacular results in terms of the cost takeout that they've done.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/avis-budget-group-inc-car-q2-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"CAR 2021 Q3","e":"car","d":"2021-11-02","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Joe Ferraro","x":"…is that selling cars, especially in the future when the residual values may not be as robust as they are today, is going to be highly dependent on our ability to sell cars direct to consumer, and we worked tirelessly on getting a platform that enables to do that in a much more integrated fashion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/avis-budget-group-inc-car-q3-2021-earnings-call-tr/"},{"c":"CAR 2025 Q4","e":"car","d":"2026-02-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brian J. Choi","x":"So Manheim values, if you recall, they were roughly flat year over year in the first quarter, and then amid tariff uncertainty, it really spiked into the second and third quarter, and then it exited the year essentially flat again.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/avis-budget-car-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAR 2025 Q4","e":"car","d":"2026-02-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brian J. Choi","x":"Those forward-looking economic models assume the impact of tariffs to continue throughout the life of these vehicles.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/avis-budget-car-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAR 2025 Q4","e":"car","d":"2026-02-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cunha","x":"Since then, buyers have returned, and in 2026, we are actively utilizing every disposition channel available to right-size our fleet.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/avis-budget-car-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAR 2025 Q4","e":"car","d":"2026-02-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cunha","x":"Our fleet right-sizing strategy also prompted us to take a hard look at how we structure our OEM partnerships.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/avis-budget-car-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAR 2026 Q1","e":"car","d":"2026-04-29","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Choi","x":"And we're also doing more kind of internally in terms of our direct-to-consumer sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/avis-car-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAR 2026 Q1","e":"car","d":"2026-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cunha","x":"This marks the first quarter of positive pricing in the Americas since the fourth quarter of 2022, and we view that as a meaningful inflection point.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/avis-car-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAR 2026 Q1","e":"car","d":"2026-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cunha","x":"I'll just add, Brian, that this is first positive pricing in the fourth quarter of 2022, right?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/avis-car-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAR 2026 Q1","e":"car","d":"2026-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cunha","x":"We also took advantage of first quarter strength in the used car market to further rightsize the fleet.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/avis-car-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAR 2026 Q1","e":"car","d":"2026-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Choi","x":"We had to rightsize the fleet that came at a cost, and you saw that in the EBITDA impact this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/avis-car-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAR 2026 Q1","e":"car","d":"2026-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cunha","x":"As a result, we are raising our full year guidance to a range of $850 million to $1 billion in adjusted EBITDA.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/avis-car-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CAR 2026 Q3","e":"car","d":"2026-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Cunha","x":"The decline in rental days reflects last year's network restructuring and customer mix changes, and the trend has improved by approximately one point each quarter this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/avis-car-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"